---Returns the chronological change history for the resource identified by the given organization-scoped audit log entry. The endpoint first locates the source audit log entry by `id` (using `action_time` to narrow the lookup window), derives identifying filters from that entry, and then returns matching audit logs within the `since`/`before` window. The `result_info.history_status` field indicates the quality of the resource identification used: - `exact`: Resource was identified by the resource URI. - `approximate`: Resource was identified without the resource URI. - `unavailable`: The source audit log entry did not contain enough information to identify the resource; an empty result is returned.
---
---`GET /organizations/{organization_id}/logs/audit/{id}/history`
---@param input cloudflare.organizations.LogsAuditHistoryRequest
---@return cloudflare.organizations.LogsAuditHistoryResultList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:logs_audit_history(input) end

---Partially updates the business profile (name, email, phone, address, and external metadata) associated with this organization's customer record, creating the profile if it does not exist. Changes apply to every account and organization sharing that profile. Omitted, empty, or null fields are left unchanged. Each profile field is limited to 1,000 UTF-8 bytes. Only available to members of the organization.
---
---`PUT /organizations/{organization_id}/profile`
---Errors: OrganizationNotFound, Forbidden.
---@param input cloudflare.organizations.PutOrganizationProfileRequest
---@return cloudflare.organizations.PutOrganizationProfileResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:put_organization_profile(input) end

